<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>畅行旅行 - 发现您的下一次旅行</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #0066cc;
            --primary-dark: #004c99;
            --secondary-color: #ff9900;
            --text-main: #333333;
            --text-light: #666666;
            --bg-light: #f5f7fa;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --border-radius: 8px;
            --shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            color: var(--text-main);
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            background: var(--white);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            height: 70px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a.active {
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }

        .header-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 16px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: none;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--primary-color);
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: var(--primary-color);
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--primary-color);
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: var(--primary-dark);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)), url('https://picsum.photos/seed/travelhero/1440/600.jpg') center/cover no-repeat;
            height: 500px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* Search Box */
        .search-container {
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1.5fr 1fr auto;
            gap: 15px;
            align-items: end;
        }

        .input-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .input-group label {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .input-group input, .input-group select {
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 14px;
            outline: none;
        }

        .input-group input:focus, .input-group select:focus {
            border-color: var(--primary-color);
        }

        .btn-search {
            height: 46px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        /* Categories */
        .categories {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 60px auto 30px;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .category-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .category-card {
            position: relative;
            height: 150px;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .category-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.5s;
        }

        .category-card:hover img {
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        .category-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,0.7));
            padding: 15px;
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .category-overlay h3 {
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        /* Features */
        .features {
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 60px 0;
            margin-top: 40px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .features-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .feature-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            max-width: 300px;
        }

        .feature-icon {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background: rgba(0, 102, 204, 0.1);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: #222;
            color: #aaa;
            padding: 40px 0 20px;
            margin-top: 60px;
        }

        .footer-content {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .footer-col h4 {
            color: var(--white);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .footer-col ul li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .footer-col ul li a:hover {
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .copyright {
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #333;
            padding-top: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* Mobile Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }
            .search-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                padding: 20px;
            }
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }
            .footer-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <div class="nav-container">
        <a href="index.html" class="logo">畅行 <span>旅行</span></a>
        <nav class="nav-links">
            <a href="index.html" class="active">首页</a>
            <a href="#">国内游</a>
            <a href="#">海外游</a>
            <a href="#">特惠活动</a>
            <a href="#">会员中心</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="header-actions">
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline">登录</a>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">注册</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
    <div>
        <h1>探索中国之美</h1>
        <p>预订北京、上海、三亚、成都等地的酒店与行程</p>

        <div class="search-container">
            <div class="input-group">
                <label>目的地</label>
                <input type="text" placeholder="城市、酒店或景点名称">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label>入住日期</label>
                <input type="date">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label>离店日期</label>
                <input type="date">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label>住客数</label>
                <select>
                    <option>1人</option>
                    <option>2人</option>
                    <option>3人</option>
                    <option>4人</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <button onclick="window.location.href='search_results.html'" class="btn btn-primary btn-search">搜索</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="categories">
    <h2 class="section-title">热门目的地</h2>
    <div class="category-grid">
        <div class="category-card" onclick="window.location.href='search_results.html'">
            <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/beijing/400/300.jpg" alt="北京">
            <div class="category-overlay">
                <h3>北京</h3>
                <p>人文历史与现代化都市</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="category-card" onclick="window.location.href='search_results.html'">
            <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/sanya/400/300.jpg" alt="三亚">
            <div class="category-overlay">
                <h3>三亚</h3>
                <p>热带海岛阳光沙滩</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="category-card" onclick="window.location.href='search_results.html'">
            <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/chengdu/400/300.jpg" alt="成都">
            <div class="category-overlay">
                <h3>成都</h3>
                <p>悠闲生活与美味火锅</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="category-card" onclick="window.location.href='search_results.html'">
            <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/xian/400/300.jpg" alt="西安">
            <div class="category-overlay">
                <h3>西安</h3>
                <p>古丝绸之路起点</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="features">
    <div class="features-container">
        <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-icon">✓</div>
            <div>
                <h4>最优惠价格</h4>
                <p>保证全网最低价，提前预订立减20%</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-icon">₩</div>
            <div>
                <h4>无忧退款</h4>
                <p>取消政策灵活，支持24小时免费取消</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-icon">🛡️</div>
            <div>
                <h4>安全预订</h4>
                <p>银行级SSL加密，保障您的资金与隐私安全</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <div class="footer-content">
        <div class="footer-col">
            <h4>关于我们</h4>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#">品牌故事</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">加入我们</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">新闻动态</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col">
            <h4>帮助中心</h4>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#">预订指南</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">取消政策</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">常见问题</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">联系客服</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col">
            <h4>合作伙伴</h4>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#">酒店入住</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">旅游业者</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">联盟计划</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col">
            <h4>联系方式</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>客服热线：400-123-4567</li>
                <li>邮箱：support@changxingtravel.com</li>
                <li>地址：北京市朝阳区科技园路88号</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="copyright">
        &copy; 2023 畅行旅行. 保留所有权利.
    </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
